OL,3,GNEWSAAirport's air-con offer to tackle
OL,4,Anight flight noise
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomeowners near Leeds Bradford Airport
OL,7,Fcould be given money to install air
OL,8,Fconditioning in bedrooms to help reduce
OL,9,Fnoise from night-time flights.
OL,11,FAirport bosses said the proposed offer
OL,12,Fwas a first for UK airports, with
OL,13,Fgrants to replace windows also
OL,14,Fannounced as part of new proposals to
OL,15,F"modernise" its night flying rules.
OL,17,FLeeds Bradford Airport (LBA) had been
OL,18,Faccused of breaching a night-flight
OL,19,Flimit during the summer season by
OL,20,Fcampaigners, but Leeds City Council
OL,21,Fruled it had not breached the cap.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
